{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Pochard Jamie&quot;</strong> is a platform action-puzzle game. The diving duck Jamie encounters numerous difficulties during migration. Unlock new levels, scenes, and items to help Jamie complete his mysterious migratory journey.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Box-pushing is the core gameplay. The scenes contain various types of boxes\u2014ordinary boxes can be pushed simply by attacking, while special boxes, such as those with mechanisms, require triggering specific conditions to move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840320/extras/f6bd05f9bac72a2359b7d3e8bb32a269.poster.avif?t=1754462993\" width=400 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840320/extras/f6bd05f9bac72a2359b7d3e8bb32a269.webm?t=1754462993\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840320/extras/f6bd05f9bac72a2359b7d3e8bb32a269.mp4?t=1754462993\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Directionality</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some boxes are marked with directional arrows and will move in that direction when attacked. When Jamie changes his horizontal direction, the box's direction will also change. Some boxes, however, have no directionality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840320/extras/bbbc64c182ce1305cf48f2b5c5fb4b12.poster.avif?t=1754462993\" width=400 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840320/extras/bbbc64c182ce1305cf48f2b5c5fb4b12.webm?t=1754462993\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840320/extras/bbbc64c182ce1305cf48f2b5c5fb4b12.mp4?t=1754462993\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Jumping</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jamie can jump flexibly, but the jumping distance is limited. Construct the correct box positions and use them as stepping stones to overcome challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840320/extras/1e6ae177ef30c52a3a79c8ad42e349c6.poster.avif?t=1754462993\" width=400 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840320/extras/1e6ae177ef30c52a3a79c8ad42e349c6.webm?t=1754462993\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840320/extras/1e6ae177ef30c52a3a79c8ad42e349c6.mp4?t=1754462993\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Environmental Elements</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to boxes, wind, snow, water, mechanisms, and so on will all become obstacles for Jamie.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840320/extras/601cc11bf7e7415d87832d11a96f2f89.poster.avif?t=1754462993\" width=400 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840320/extras/601cc11bf7e7415d87832d11a96f2f89.webm?t=1754462993\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840320/extras/601cc11bf7e7415d87832d11a96f2f89.mp4?t=1754462993\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3840320?t=1754462993","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840320/c63ae4b7533e689bd3b122f47c5407ca795b5e56/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1754462993","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840320/eef52d3349a57997503a6b7455211458fadf30be/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754462993","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840320/eef52d3349a57997503a6b7455211458fadf30be/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754462993","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3909440,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Pochard Jamie&quot;</strong> is a platform action-puzzle game. The diving duck Jamie encounters numerous difficulties during migration. Unlock new levels, scenes, and items to help Jamie complete his mysterious migratory journey.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Box-pushing is the core gameplay. The scenes contain various types of boxes\u2014ordinary boxes can be pushed simply by attacking, while special boxes, such as those with mechanisms, require triggering specific conditions to move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840320/extras/f6bd05f9bac72a2359b7d3e8bb32a269.poster.avif?t=1754462993\" width=400 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840320/extras/f6bd05f9bac72a2359b7d3e8bb32a269.webm?t=1754462993\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840320/extras/f6bd05f9bac72a2359b7d3e8bb32a269.mp4?t=1754462993\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Directionality</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some boxes are marked with directional arrows and will move in that direction when attacked. When Jamie changes his horizontal direction, the box's direction will also change. Some boxes, however, have no directionality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840320/extras/bbbc64c182ce1305cf48f2b5c5fb4b12.poster.avif?t=1754462993\" width=400 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840320/extras/bbbc64c182ce1305cf48f2b5c5fb4b12.webm?t=1754462993\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840320/extras/bbbc64c182ce1305cf48f2b5c5fb4b12.mp4?t=1754462993\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Jumping</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jamie can jump flexibly, but the jumping distance is limited. Construct the correct box positions and use them as stepping stones to overcome challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840320/extras/1e6ae177ef30c52a3a79c8ad42e349c6.poster.avif?t=1754462993\" width=400 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840320/extras/1e6ae177ef30c52a3a79c8ad42e349c6.webm?t=1754462993\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840320/extras/1e6ae177ef30c52a3a79c8ad42e349c6.mp4?t=1754462993\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Environmental Elements</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to boxes, wind, snow, water, mechanisms, and so on will all become obstacles for Jamie.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840320/extras/601cc11bf7e7415d87832d11a96f2f89.poster.avif?t=1754462993\" width=400 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840320/extras/601cc11bf7e7415d87832d11a96f2f89.webm?t=1754462993\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840320/extras/601cc11bf7e7415d87832d11a96f2f89.mp4?t=1754462993\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["SOLARLAKE"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840320/9f21d392a801326f2bb5c5dff4cf0d09048b25df/header.jpg?t=1754462993","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 14.04 LTS<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.0 GHZ<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 2 GB<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 10.15 Catalina<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple silicon or Int